 that actually stay in during a run, smart home gear you've been thinking of adding to your cart for months. Here are the deals are still live, but they won't be for long.</p><div class="col-body"><section class="mb-5 2xl:hidden px-0" id="article-toc-49c602cd-c78b-4ee9-b39d-a432d255789c"><details class="rounded-lg border border-dirty-seagull bg-white"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between p-4"><span class="font-semibold text-[20px]/[26px]">In this story</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="flex-none text-primary [&_path]:fill-current"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.001 12.627 1.375 6l1.626-1.626 5 5 5-5L14.628 6z" /></svg></summary><nav class="overflow-hidden p-4 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"><ul class="flex flex-col md:gap-5 gap-3"><li class="flex flex-col md:gap-5 gap-3"><a data-ylk="cpos:1;elm:anchor-tag;itc:1;pkgt:h2-pm;sec:table-of-contents;slk:Best Memorial Day sales: Top deals;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:1,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;anchor-tag&quot;,&quot;yPackageType&quot;:&quot;h2-pm&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;table-of-contents&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Best Memorial Day sales: Top deals&quot;}" href="https://tech.yahoo.com/deals/breaking-news/article/memorial-day-sales-on-tech-are-still-available-shop-extended-deals-up-to-50-off-from-amazon-apple-best-buy-and-more-181434135.html#best-memorial-day-sales-top-deals" class="relative line-clamp-2 flex items-start overflow-hidden break-words text-left text-inkwell text-[15px]/[20px]" role="option" data-rapid_p="65"><span>Best Memorial Day sales: Top deals</span></a><ul class="flex flex-col md:gap-5 gap-3"><li><a data-ylk="cpos:1;elm:anchor-tag;itc:1;pkgt:h2-pm;pos:1;sec:table-of-contents;slk:Anker Soundcore 2 Portable Bluetooth Speaker;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:1,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;anchor-tag&quot;,&quot;yPackageType